stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> createdLocally: save (new)
  synced --> updatedLocally: save (edit)
  synced --> pendingDelete: delete
  createdLocally --> synced: upsert pushed
  updatedLocally --> synced: upsert pushed
  createdLocally --> upsertFailed: 3 failures
  updatedLocally --> upsertFailed: 3 failures
  upsertFailed --> synced: retried at the next app start
  pendingDelete --> [*]: delete pushed, row removed
  pendingDelete --> tombstone: delete pushed, trash kept
  pendingDelete --> deleteFailed: 3 failures
  state "synced tombstone (deleted_at set)" as tombstone
  note right of pendingDelete: hidden from every list at once
